Modifications made by the TypeFeng fork (2026-11-02):
  * Rebranded the application, windows, tray, menus, permission strings,
    onboarding copy, About page and icons to "TypeFeng"; changed the bundle
    identifier to top.typefeng.desktop and the version to 1.0.0.
  * Disabled the upstream auto-update endpoint and update checks so a
    TypeFeng build cannot be replaced by an upstream/other binary.
  * Removed upstream community/QQ/Discord/website entry points from the
    in-app About page; links now point at this fork and at the upstream
    project for attribution.
  * Replaced the macOS icon set (.icns and PNGs) and the About icon.
  * Removed upstream CI workflows that are specific to the OpenLess release
    pipeline and added a TypeFeng macOS build workflow.
  * Internal Rust crate names remain "openless"/"openless_core" for
    compatibility with upstream; all user-visible branding is TypeFeng.

